      "description": "Watch Instituto Cordoba vs Gimnasia M. highlights and goals from Argentine Primera División on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 9, 2026. High Stakes in Cordoba On August 9, 2026, the stage was set for a rigorous encounter between Instituto Cordoba and Gimnasia M. in the Liga Profesional Argentina . The match began as a tactical chess match, with both sides displaying discipline and aggression in a first half defined by physical battles across the midfield. The Turning Point The tempo accelerated dramatically after the interval as both teams looked to force an opening. The tension reached its peak in the 76th minute when Instituto Cordoba were awarded a penalty, only for Alex Luna to miss the target from the spot. Showing immense character, Luna did not let the frustration linger. He surged forward just four minutes later in the 80th minute to connect with an assist from Jeremias Lazaro , firing the ball home to break the deadlock and ignite the home crowd. A Tense Finale The final minutes saw a flurry of cards as the contest descended into a frantic struggle. Gimnasia M. pushed forward in search of an equalizer, but the Instituto Cordoba defense remained resolute under mounting pressure. The referee’s whistle finally halted the late-game chaos, confirming a hard-fought victory for the home side in a match that will be remembered for its shifting emotions and the resilience shown in the face of a missed opportunity."
