      "description": "Watch Atletico Tucuman vs Instituto Cordoba highlights and goals from Argentine Primera División on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 22, 2026. The match between Atlético Tucumán and Instituto Cordoba in the Liga Profesional Argentina tested the resilience of both squads in a high-stakes encounter. A Battle of Will and Temperament On August 22, 2026, the atmosphere was electric as both teams vied for dominance. The physical nature of the contest became clear early on, with Leonel Di Placido picking up a yellow card within the first ten minutes. The referee remained busy throughout, also cautioning Nicolas Lamendola as the game grew increasingly fractious during the opening half. The Turning Point As the second half progressed, the pressure to secure a result led to heightened aggression. After bookings for Matias Gallardo and Leonel Vega , the game reached a boiling point in the 77th minute when Nicolas Lamendola was shown a straight red card. The dismissal sparked heavy protests, leaving his teammates to navigate the closing stages with ten men. Despite a flurry of substitutions from both sides, including the introduction of Ignacio Mendez and Pedro Canelo , neither team could find the decisive breakthrough before the referee signaled the end of the match."
